# Sveltia CMS / posts

Pending work: `.cursor/plans/sveltia-cms.md` (hub). Do not invent a parallel auth or soft-launch approach.

## Must preserve

- Pin `@sveltia/cms` in `admin/index.html` (versioned unpkg URL); bump deliberately.
- Auth: `auth_methods: [token]` until OAuth is un-parked (plan). No client secret in this repo.
- Workflow: simple commit to `main` (not editorial). `skip_ci: true` unless changing publish policy on purpose.
- i18n: `multiple_files`, `default_locale: it`, `omit_default_locale_from_file_path: true` → `Stem.md` / `Stem.en.md` / `Stem.fr.md`.
- `lang`: hidden widget, `default: "{{locale}}"`, `i18n: true` — never a manual select.
- Dates: `type: date` (ISO). Day.js — `YYYY-MM-DD` / not `yyyy-MM-dd` (`dd` is weekday).
- Slugs: `encoding: ascii`, `clean_accents: true`, `lowercase: false`; post slug `{{year}}-{{month}}-{{day}}-{{slug}}`.
- Cover `public_folder: posts`; body media `/assets/img/posts`.
- `output.omit_empty_optional_fields: true`.
- Republication: optional object `republication` with `publisher` + `publication_link` — not flat keys. Template and `content_lint` expect the nest.
